    "title": "What Does a Free Period Tracker Actually Cost The Data Price",
    "description": "Free period trackers are paid for with data: advertising targeting, health data broker sales, analytics SDK sharing, and legal exposure. The FTC's action against Flo documented exactly how this works.",
