    "title": "Exercise During Your Period: What's Safe, What Helps, and What to Avoid",
    "description": "Exercise during your period is safe and often beneficial - endorphins reduce prostaglandin-mediated cramping, and light movement improves flow symptoms. Here's what the research shows.",
