        "question": "What on-device app replaces Natural Cycles for contraception tracking?",
        "answer": "Natural Cycles is FDA-cleared contraception. That designation requires clinical validation that general cycle trackers do not have. If you are using Natural Cycles as contraception, consult with a healthcare provider before switching to a non-FDA-cleared method. For tracking cycles without contraceptive reliance, Floriva and Euki are on-device options."
