        "title": "Configure Floriva for irregular cycle length",
        "content": "PCOS cycles often don't follow a fixed length. A cycle might be 35 days, then 60 days, then 28 days. In Floriva, disable any fixed-cycle-length assumptions and set your cycle tracking to 'variable.' This prevents the app from generating predictions based on an average that doesn't apply to you. Log each period start date as it arrives, and Floriva will track actual cycle lengths rather than predicted ones."
